  itemName: Sword
  itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8922d1b927429f04c8d3130cf763534c, type: 3}
  description: "During the Revolutionary War, most infantrymen carried a hanger \u2014
    a type of short sword, with a blade about twenty-five inches long \u2014 as a
    secondary weapon to supplement their musket in close combat. This sword is based
    on the one carried by Massachusetts minute man James Taylor."
